# Velvet Capital Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Velvet Capital.

Velvet Capital is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi and onchain asset management smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Velvet Capital  
Audit type: DeFi asset management smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[Softstack_Smart_Contract_Audit_Velvet_Capital.pdf](./Softstack_Smart_Contract_Audit_Velvet_Capital.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work for DeFi asset management and vault related infrastructure.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to DeFi asset management, vault systems and onchain investment infrastructure.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
